-- inputs of 424.1: threatens; intent to compel; the offence; United Nations personnel (s 2); associated personnel (s 2)
#ASSERT `s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` TRUE TRUE (`ccc13 test the provision` 235 "") (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` TRUE TRUE (`ccc13 test the provision` 235 "") (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` TRUE TRUE (`ccc13 test the provision` 235 "") (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` TRUE TRUE (`ccc13 test the provision` 431.1 "") (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` TRUE TRUE (`ccc13 test the provision` 431 "") (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE       -- section 431 is 424's, not 424.1's
#ASSERT `s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` TRUE FALSE (`ccc13 test the provision` 431.1 "") (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE     -- fork F11: no intent to compel
