§ `the prohibitions as regulative rules (SHANT): doing the act is the breach`
#TRACE `s 423.1(1) the prohibition on the person` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 423.1(1) engage in conduct with the intent to provoke a state of fear` AT 1
#TRACE `s 423.1(1) the prohibition on the person` NOTHING AT 0 WITH
#TRACE `s 425.1(1) the prohibition on the person` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the accused` DOES `s 425.1(1) take a disciplinary measure against, demote, terminate or otherwise adversely affect the employment of an employee, or threaten to do so` AT 1
#TRACE `s 425.1(1) the prohibition on the person` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
